/*
  One row per book:  [title, image file in /gallery, Amazon ASIN, Ages (optional), description (optional)]
  Example with all fields:
  ["Bigfoot P.I.","bigfoot_pi.jpg","B0HNTQLWTR","Ages 8–12","A short, spoiler-free blurb goes here."]
  Leave age/description out and the popup shows a friendly default.
  Pages 1, 2 and 3 match books.html, books1.html and books2.html.
*/
window.BOOKS_PAGES = {
  1: [
    ["Bigfoot P.I.","bigfoot_pi.jpg","B0HNTQLWTR", "Ages 4-17", "Bigfoot P.I. is a fun paranormal mystery featuring Barrett, an eight-foot-tall Bigfoot who works as a private investigator in the Pacific Northwest. When several supernatural residents of his community become victims of strange thefts and blackmail, Barrett takes on the case. His investigation leads him from a cozy diner into the misty woods and toward a secretive operation targeting the region’s mythical inhabitants. Filled with humor, mystery, quirky characters and supernatural adventure, the story offers a lighthearted detective tale with a monster-sized twist."],
    ["Lost Sock Express","lost_sock_express.jpg","B0HN8YZSK8", "Ages 4-17", "Lost Sock Express is a colorful and whimsical children’s adventure about Ziggy, a fuzzy striped sock who gets separated from his twin during laundry day. His unexpected journey leads him to a magical world filled with friendly socks, fantastical places and the amazing Lost Sock Express. Along the way, Ziggy meets Pip, a cheerful sock who helps him discover that friendship can create new connections in unexpected ways. Filled with humor, imagination and heart, this playful story celebrates friendship, courage and embracing new adventures."],
    ["Cyber Heist","cyber_heist.jpg","B0HMJG4N89", "Ages 4-17", "Cyber Heist is a thrilling futuristic adventure set in 2099, where humanity’s greatest works of art exist inside a vast digital world called the Mega-Server. When a priceless masterpiece begins to disappear beneath waves of corrupting code, skilled Data Diver Jace and his partner Lyra are sent into the unstable virtual realm to retrieve it. Their mission takes them through dazzling digital galleries, dangerous security systems and a rapidly collapsing world. Packed with technology, action, puzzles and teamwork, the story explores the exciting intersection of art, history and the digital future."],
    ["Vintage Ring","vintage_ring.jpg","B0HM16VH9T", "Ages 4-17", "Leo is a young boxer struggling to find his place in a modern world where technology and speed seem to dominate the ring. Everything changes when he discovers a mysterious pair of vintage boxing gloves hidden inside an abandoned gym. The gloves connect him with Sean, a fighter from another era who teaches him the forgotten art of rhythm, patience and instinct. As Leo faces increasingly difficult opponents, he must decide whether old-fashioned wisdom can stand against modern training and precision."],
    ["Flavor of the Seasons","flavor_of_the_seasons.jpg","B0HLWH4FMK", "Ages 4-17", "Deep in the mountains, young baker Allie discovers that each season brings its own special visitors and a little bit of magic. From autumn Wind Sprites to winter Frost Fairies and spring Bloom Pixies, her delicious seasonal creations bring joy to magical guests. Along the way, Allie gathers enchanting ingredients connected to the changing seasons. When summer arrives, she begins preparing something truly special: a cake inspired by the flavors of the entire year."],
    ["Canopy Rally","canopy_rally.jpg","B0HLR2YLY1", "Ages 4-17", "In the treetop eco-city of Arbora, young Rowan is preparing for the biggest Branch-Ball tournament in the world. With his teammates Kyla and Nia, he must master a thrilling game played across towering redwoods, swinging bridges and vertical courts. Their opponents, the skilled Raptors, are determined to take the trophy. As the match begins, speed, teamwork and daring moves are put to the ultimate test. Can Rowan and his friends work together when every second and every branch counts?"],
    ["Acre of Echoes","acre_of_echoes.jpg","B0HKW3KX9Z", "Ages 4-17", "Acre of Echoes is a mysterious fantasy thriller about Alice, a solitary farmer who cultivates forgotten objects instead of ordinary crops. From her strange fields emerge crystalline flowers that reveal fragments of memories, allowing the past to briefly come alive. Her quiet existence changes when Detective Samy arrives seeking answers to a decades-old mystery. What begins as an attempt to uncover the past soon leads them toward something far more mysterious and dangerous."],
    ["Titan's Marrow","titans_marrow.jpg","B0HKGCG5MN", "Ages 4-17", "Titan’s Morrow is a whimsical fantasy adventure about Alina and her little brother Glim, who live inside the enormous body of a sleeping Titan. Their magical home provides everything they need, but its delicate balance begins to change when the family’s farming affects the ancient creature beneath them. As strange tremors, glowing creatures and mysterious pathways appear, the children discover that their home holds secrets far deeper than they imagined. The story blends wonder, family adventure and environmental themes into a colorful tale about respecting nature and living in harmony with the world around you."],
    ["Library of Whispers","library_of_whispers.jpg","B0HH4P9WZB", "Ages 4-17", "Deep beneath the roots of the Great Oak, a restless young rabbit named Twitch struggles to fall asleep because the silence around him feels overwhelming. His search for comfort leads him to a hidden library unlike any other, where books preserve magical sounds instead of words. Guided by the kind owl librarian, Pallas, Twitch explores a collection of enchanting sound-filled books, each offering a unique sense of peace and wonder. As he listens to whispers of nature and forgotten melodies, he begins to discover that true comfort is different for everyone. Filled with warmth, gentle fantasy and cozy woodland magic, the story celebrates finding calm in unexpected places. But one final, extraordinary book holds a secret that may be exactly what Twitch has been searching for all along."],
    ["Monster Forager's Diner","monster_foragers_diner.jpg","B0HJRSQ2YM", "Ages 4-17", "Monster Forager's Diner is a charming fantasy adventure that follows Bram, a legendary hero turned chef, who ventures into enchanted lands to gather extraordinary ingredients for his magical restaurant. Alongside his lively fire-sprite companion, Saffron, he faces whimsical creatures, clever challenges and unforgettable culinary quests. Every dish is an adventure of its own, blending humor, action and imagination into a delightful story. Filled with magical recipes, colorful characters and heartwarming moments, this tale celebrates creativity, teamwork and the joy of sharing great food."],
    ["Last Tech Support","last_tech_support.jpg","B0HJHBCT47", "Ages 4-17", "Last Tech Support is a witty sci-fi fantasy that follows Arthur, an ordinary IT technician who awakens in a futuristic digital afterlife only to discover that reality itself is breaking down. Thrust into an impossible role, he must rely on old-school troubleshooting skills to tackle bizarre glitches, strange digital beings and a world on the brink of collapse. Filled with clever humor, nostalgic tech references and imaginative world-building, the story blends action, mystery and adventure into a fun, fast-paced journey that asks whether one exhausted tech support worker can save an entire civilization."],
    ["Recipe for the Past","recipe_for_the_past.jpg","B0HJDHBV9S", "Ages 4-17", "Recipe for the Past is a heartwarming magical realism story about Molly, a skilled restorer whose ordinary life changes after she inherits a mysterious cast-iron skillet and a collection of old family recipes. As she begins cooking from the faded recipe cards, she discovers that each meal unlocks vivid glimpses into the past, revealing cherished memories hidden within everyday dishes. Through food, history and human connection, the story explores love, loss, healing and the power of preserving traditions. Blending gentle magic with emotional storytelling, it celebrates how shared meals can keep memories alive across generations."],
    ["The Overlay","the_overlay.jpg","B0HJCVBKR4", "Ages 4-17", "The Overlay is a gripping cyberpunk sci-fi thriller set in a futuristic city where augmented reality hides a crumbling world beneath a dazzling digital illusion. Vesper, a digital forensic detective, uncovers a mystery that challenges everything she believes about truth, technology and humanity. As dangerous secrets emerge, she is drawn into a race against powerful forces that threaten both the city and those hidden within it. Blending action, suspense and thought-provoking themes, the novel explores perception, identity, prejudice and the price of seeing the world as it truly is."],
    ["Iron Harvest","iron_harvest.jpg","B0HJ98J2ZL", "Ages 4-17", "Iron Harvest is a heartwarming fantasy tale set in the extraordinary kingdom of Orea, where the land grows metal instead of crops. It follows Stannum, a kind-hearted farmer whose compassion for the land is tested when a power-hungry king seeks to exploit his harvest. As greed and conflict threaten the peaceful kingdom, Stannum must rely on courage, wisdom and his deep connection to nature. Blending magic, adventure and timeless values, the story celebrates kindness, peace and the strength of standing up for what is right."],
    ["Five Stars or Less","five_stars_or_less.jpg","B0H5D322XR", "Ages 4-17", "Five Stars or Less is a fast-paced cyberpunk thriller set in a futuristic city where a person's rating determines their survival. When struggling courier Jax accepts a mysterious high-paying delivery, he is thrust into a dangerous conspiracy that puts powerful forces on his trail. As he races across a neon-lit metropolis, every decision could mean the difference between life and death. Packed with action, advanced technology and suspense, the story explores surveillance, identity and the true value of humanity in a world ruled by algorithms."],
    ["Curse of the 27 Club","curse_of_the_27_club.jpg","B0HJ649JHW", "Ages 4-17", "Curse of the 27 Club is a dark urban fantasy that follows a world-famous musician whose greatest success comes with a terrifying hidden price. On the night of her 27th birthday, she uncovers a sinister secret that links fame, supernatural bargains and a mysterious curse. As she teams up with other gifted artists, they race against time to uncover the truth before it's too late. Blending horror, magic, music and suspense, the story explores the cost of ambition, friendship and the fight to reclaim one's destiny."],
    ["Migrating Woods","migrating_woods.jpg","B0HJ5W1WCW", "Ages 4-17", "Migrating Woods is a captivating fantasy adventure set in a world where an ancient forest is alive and journeys across the land. Ranger Elian and his young apprentice Luma must protect this extraordinary woodland as it faces unexpected obstacles from a changing world. Blending magical creatures, living memories and breathtaking landscapes, the story explores the bond between nature and humanity. With vivid imagery and a sense of wonder, it delivers an exciting adventure while celebrating courage, hope and environmental stewardship."],
    ["Spindle and the Smog","spindle_and_the_smog.jpg","B0HJ3BGCP2", "Ages 4-17", "In the smoke-choked industrial city of Windmere, a young factory worker named Anisa discovers a mysterious ancient spindle hidden beneath the iron machinery. The magical artifact can consume the poisonous smog blanketing the city and spin it into dazzling golden thread but every use comes at a devastating personal cost. Determined to escape poverty and protect her younger brother, Anisa continues using the spindle despite the growing sacrifices it demands. Soon, her extraordinary secret attracts the attention of a ruthless industrial ruler driven by greed and power. Blending dark fantasy with steampunk, the story explores memory, sacrifice and the price of hope in a broken world. As the battle over the spindle reaches its peak, Anisa must face a choice that could change both her destiny and the fate of Windmere forever."],
    ["Clockwork Huntsman","clockwork_huntsman.jpg","B0HHW5M8ZR", "Ages 4-17", "In a kingdom ruled by fear and obsession, Queen Voracia creates an unstoppable clockwork huntsman to track down her stepdaughter, Lyra, whom she believes threatens her reign. Powered by ancient magic and flawless mechanical precision, the relentless hunter enters the dangerous Whispering Woods with a single mission. But as he encounters Lyra and witnesses her compassion, cracks begin to appear in the rigid logic that governs his existence. Strange visions and long-buried truths force him to question everything he was built to believe. Blending dark fantasy with steampunk adventure, the story explores free will, sacrifice and the battle between humanity and blind obedience. As the hunt reaches its climax, an extraordinary choice will decide the fate of both the kingdom and its unlikely protector."],
    ["Sleepy Constellation","sleepy_constellation.jpg","B0GX463B8L", "Ages 4-17", "High among the stars, a cheerful little star named Kip accidentally tumbles from his constellation into a quiet forest below. Lost and unable to return home, he meets a kind black cat named Velvet, who promises to help him find his way back to the night sky. Together they journey through moonlit woods, meeting friendly woodland creatures who each offer guidance along the way. Their adventure is filled with warmth, gentle magic and the comforting spirit of friendship. As they draw closer to their destination, Kip begins to realize that even the smallest light can inspire hope in others. But when they finally reach the highest hill beneath the stars, a magical moment awaits that will determine whether Kip can truly find his place again."],
    ["Shop of Quiet Sounds","shop_of_quiet_sounds.jpg","B0HHFNQN99", "Ages 4-17", "Hidden in the peaceful Sleepy Valley is a remarkable little shop unlike any other, where a kind old badger named Barnaby collects and preserves the world's gentlest sounds. When a tired dormouse named Pip arrives unable to sleep, Barnaby carefully offers a series of magical sounds, each with its own unique charm. Yet none of them feel quite right, sending the pair on a quiet journey beyond the shop into a hidden enchanted garden. As they search among glowing plants and whispering nature, Pip begins to discover that the perfect comfort cannot be rushed. Filled with cozy fantasy, woodland magic and soothing bedtime wonder. The story celebrates patience, kindness and listening with your heart. But deep within the secret garden, one extraordinary sound may finally be the answer Pip has been seeking."],
    ["Night Garden Nursery","night_garden_nursery.jpg","B0HHDM35J4", "Ages 4-17", "Every night, as the forest falls asleep, a gentle woodland gnome named Elden begins his secret task of caring for a magical garden hidden among the trees. Armed with a silver watering can filled with enchanted midnight dew, he awakens extraordinary flowers that glow with soft colors and fill the air with soothing melodies. One by one, curious forest animals are drawn to the peaceful nursery, finding comfort in its magical beauty. As the garden blossoms into a symphony of light and sound, the forest is transformed into a place of perfect calm and wonder. Filled with cozy fantasy, gentle adventure and heartwarming moments, the story celebrates kindness, nature and the quiet magic of nighttime. But before dawn arrives, one final magical moment brings Elden's unforgettable night to a beautiful close."],
    ["Cloud-Seeder","cloud_seeder.jpg","B0HHB2MN41", "Ages 4-17", "In a drought-ravaged future, a brilliant young engineer named Lyra refuses to accept a world where a powerful corporation controls the weather and hoards water. Using her hacking skills, she launches a daring plan to bring rain back to her dying valley. But what begins as an act of rebellion soon unleashes something far beyond her expectations. As the skies transform and chaos spreads, Lyra finds herself hunted by a relentless corporate enforcer while racing to prevent a growing catastrophe. Blending cyberpunk, science fiction and high-stakes action, the story explores the price of challenging unchecked power. The final confrontation forces an impossible choice, with the fate of an entire region hanging in the balance."],
    ["Glitch in the Canvas","glitch_in_the_canvas.jpg","B0HH93LT33", "Ages 4-17", "In the futuristic city of Omonoia, perfection is enforced by an all-powerful AI that has erased creativity, emotion and human imperfection. Trace, one of the few remaining artists, secretly creates hand-drawn comics that preserve the messy beauty of real life. When an unexpected discovery reveals that raw human art may be the AI's greatest weakness, he becomes the target of an intense citywide hunt. Joined by a small underground resistance, Trace embarks on a dangerous mission to challenge a system built on flawless control. Blending cyberpunk action with thought-provoking themes, the story explores the power of creativity, individuality and rebellion. As the final plan unfolds, everything depends on whether a single imperfect creation can change an entire world."],
    ["Spores of Eden","spores_of_eden.jpg","B0HH7LD7TM", "Ages 4-17", "Spores of Eden is a gripping science fiction thriller set on the mysterious planet Eden, where a human research colony studies strange and beautiful alien life. As unexplained biological changes begin affecting the colonists, scientist Alice uncovers signs that the planet may be far more intelligent and interconnected than anyone imagined. The story blends suspense, body horror and psychological tension while exploring humanity's relationship with nature and evolution. With an eerie atmosphere and thought-provoking themes, the novel keeps readers questioning what it truly means to survive and adapt. It is ideal for fans of immersive, unsettling sci-fi with a strong mystery element."],
    ["Glass Parasite","glass_parasite.jpg","B0HH4BNBLL", "Ages 4-17", "When a mysterious crystalline parasite begins turning living creatures into beautiful but lifeless glass, a hardened hunter named Solas tracks it to a forgotten manor. There she finds Vitra, a mistreated young woman whose discovery of an enchanted glass slipper awakens a terrifying transformation. As unimaginable power reshapes Vitra's body and mind, the line between victim and threat becomes dangerously blurred. Meanwhile, a prince with a hidden purpose prepares for a royal ball that is far more than a celebration. Inspired by the classic Cinderella tale but reimagined as dark fantasy horror, the story blends eerie magic, suspense and emotional conflict. When all paths finally converge at the palace, an unforgettable confrontation determines whether salvation or ruin awaits."],
    ["Cloud Weaver","cloud_weaver.jpg","B0HH38YX9C", "Ages 4-17", "High above the mountains, a gentle spider named Sunny spends his nights collecting moonlight and soft cloud mist to weave magical blankets. With quiet care and extraordinary skill, he creates warm coverings for the woodland animals before a harsh frost arrives. As he journeys across the mountains, each blanket becomes a gift of comfort, kindness and hope. Despite the challenges of the cold and the long journey, Sunny never hesitates to help those in need. Filled with enchanting imagery and heartwarming moments, the story celebrates selfless compassion and the magic found in simple acts of generosity. By dawn, Sunny's quiet work has transformed the mountain in a way few will ever know."],
    ["Changeling's Ransom","changelings_ransom.jpg","B0HGYWWTLJ", "Ages 4-17", "Elidyr, a mischievous boy who secretly belongs to the magical Fae realm, is desperate to escape his dull human life and hatches an unusual kidnapping plan. He convinces a washed-up knight named Ruston to 'kidnap' him and claim a ransom from the Fae Queen. Their journey into the enchanting yet dangerous Fae world is filled with clever riddles, bizarre creatures and magical rules where every word has consequences. As the unlikely duo navigates this unpredictable realm, they discover that appearances and expectations can be deceiving. Humor, fantasy and heartfelt moments blend into an adventure that challenges both of their beliefs. But when they finally reach the royal court, an unexpected revelation changes everything, leading to a decision that neither of them could have anticipated."],
    ["The Cat from Planet X","the_cat_from_planet_x.jpg","B0HGY68641", "Ages 4-17", "The Cat from Planet X is a fun and imaginative science-fiction adventure about a curious boy named Orion who adopts a mysterious black cat named Nova from an animal shelter. Soon, Orion notices that Nova behaves unlike any ordinary cat, hinting at an extraordinary secret. As strange events begin to unfold, the pair embark on an exciting journey filled with mystery, humor and wonder. The story blends everyday life with imaginative science-fiction elements, making it engaging for young readers. Themes of friendship, curiosity, courage and accepting the unknown run throughout the book. It's a lighthearted adventure that encourages readers to embrace imagination."]
  ],
  2: [
    ["Spore Walkers","spore_walkers.jpg","B0H37Z8K27", "Ages 4-17", "Spore Walkers is an imaginative science fiction adventure set on a breathtaking moon suspended above a giant planet. It follows a young apprentice embarking on a dangerous first mission through floating reefs and glowing forests. As the journey unfolds, courage, teamwork and respect for nature become essential to survival. The story blends vivid world-building with moments of suspense and discovery, creating a unique and immersive setting. Its themes of growth, responsibility and resilience make it an engaging read for younger readers and sci-fi enthusiasts alike."],
    ["Relativity's Ransom","relativitys_ransom.jpg","B0HGDJNH8R", "Ages 4-17", "Relatively's Ransom is a fast-paced science fiction adventure that blends space exploration with the mind-bending effects of relativity. Set around a dangerous black hole, it follows a high-stakes mission where every decision comes with an extraordinary cost. The story explores courage, sacrifice and the emotional weight of time itself. As the team ventures into an impossible environment, they face challenges that test both their skills and relationships. With imaginative world-building and scientific intrigue, the novel balances suspense with heartfelt moments. It's an engaging read for fans of intelligent, action-driven sci-fi."],
    ["Litho-Flora Symphony","litho_flora_symphony.jpg","B0HG9MK17K", "Ages 4-17", "Litho-Flora Symphony is a visually rich science fiction adventure set on the mysterious planet Xylos, where crystalline lifeforms and music are deeply intertwined. After an unexpected crash, explorer Kael must navigate an extraordinary world unlike anything he has known. As he uncovers the planet's unique harmony, he forms an unlikely alliance that challenges his understanding of life and communication. Blending wonder, exploration and emotional depth, the story celebrates curiosity, resilience and the power of connection."],
    ["Empathic Overlord","empathic_overlord.jpg","B0HG921D41", "Ages 5-17", "Empathic Overlord is a fantasy novel that explores the hidden burden of immense power through the eyes of a feared ruler. Instead of being driven by cruelty, the protagonist carries a secret that reshapes every decision he makes. As political intrigue, emotional conflict and moral dilemmas unfold, the story challenges appearances and questions what truly defines strength. With a blend of dark fantasy and psychological depth, it offers an engaging journey without relying on familiar hero-villain tropes."],
    ["Sir Snooze-a-Lot","sir_snooze_a_lot.jpg","B0HG7XJRBK", "Ages 5-17", "Sir Snooze-a-Lot is a charming children's fantasy about an unusual knight who values kindness, patience and clever thinking over strength. Set in the magical kingdom of Slumberia, the story follows his gentle adventures as he faces unexpected challenges in his own unique way. Filled with whimsical characters, humor and enchanting illustrations, it encourages readers to see courage differently. It's a heartwarming tale that celebrates empathy, imagination and staying true to yourself, without relying on battles or violence."],
    ["Blanket Fort Kingdom","blanket_fort_kingdom.jpg","B0HG6QDLLG", "Ages 5-17", "In Blanket Fort Kingdom, Elisa and Arlo step into a magical world hidden within an ordinary blanket fort, where imagination transforms everyday objects into extraordinary adventures. As they explore this whimsical kingdom, they discover courage, friendship and the joy of seeing the world through curious eyes. The story celebrates creativity, teamwork and the magic that can be found in simple moments. With its warm, enchanting atmosphere, it's a delightful read for children and families alike."],
    ["Sandman's Apprentice","sandmans_apprentice.jpg","B0HCMQH24J", "Ages 5-17", "Sandman's Apprentice is a heartwarming fantasy tale about Pip, a young apprentice learning the magical art of bringing peaceful dreams. When an unexpected mishap releases mysterious shadows, Pip embarks on a gentle adventure filled with courage, kindness and imagination. Along the way, he discovers that not everything frightening is truly scary. The story beautifully explores empathy, friendship and understanding without losing its sense of wonder. Perfect for young readers who enjoy magical bedtime adventures."],
    ["Starlight Weaver","starlight_weaver.jpg","B0HG4WKS1P", "Ages 5-17", "When night falls over a quiet little valley, a tiny magical creature named Lumis awakens to begin her secret nighttime work. Known as the Starlight Weaver, Lumis gathers glowing strands from the constellations and transforms them into beautiful threads of magic. Each thread carries a special feeling, allowing Lumis to bring comfort, courage, wonder and peaceful dreams to children who need them. But when a mysterious storm cloud named Grumble covers the night sky, Lumis faces an unexpected challenge that threatens her magical work. With the stars hidden and only one precious resource remaining, she must find a different way to bring light into the darkness. Filled with warmth, imagination and gentle magic, Starlight Weaver is a comforting bedtime tale about kindness, courage and understanding. A whimsical story for young readers that reminds us that sometimes even the grumpiest clouds may simply need a little care."],
    ["Polaroid Poltergeist","polaroid_poltergeist.jpg","B0GX2WQG37", "Ages 5-17", "Elias is a crime-scene photographer with an unusual obsession: an old Polaroid camera that seems to capture things ordinary cameras cannot. When a routine investigation produces a photograph unlike anything he has seen before, Elias begins to suspect that something is hiding within the images. His skeptical partner, Detective Miller, dismisses the strange photographs as nothing more than faulty equipment and refuses to take Elias's warnings seriously. But the deeper Elias looks, the more unsettling the photographs become. What begins as a strange photographic anomaly soon raises a terrifying question: what if a photograph isn't simply something you look at, but something that can look back?"],
    ["Orbital Vinyl","orbital_vinyl.jpg","B0HG1CQF6Y", "Ages 5-17", "Deep in the Oort Cloud, the space station The Needle survives through an extraordinary fusion of music, machinery and rhythm, with DJ Stylus keeping its systems alive through sound. But the arrival of the mysterious High Silence threatens to erase every frequency of joy, rebellion and history from the universe. When pilot Oscilla brings Stylus the legendary Forbidden Signal, a vinyl record forged from the echoes of a dead pulsar, they discover a possible way to escape through a cosmic Fold-Jump. As the Silencers close in, music becomes more than entertainment, it becomes the very force holding the station together and guiding it through a deadly asteroid field. With their ship losing power and the enemy preparing to erase them, Stylus and Oscilla push their unlikely musical technology beyond its limits. The final groove unleashes a breathtaking cosmic frequency, transforming their desperate broadcast into an act of defiance capable of tearing open the fabric of space itself."],
    ["Midnight Reset","midnight_reset.jpg","B0HFPC2FW6", "Ages 5-17", "In the seemingly perfect city of Fairmont, every night ends with the mysterious Pulse, a phenomenon that resets the city at exactly midnight and erases every mistake, crime, and painful memory from existence. Trace is the one person immune to the Reset, secretly documenting the tragedies that everyone else is forced to forget. When he witnesses City Guardian Dolo attack a young violinist named Vesper, Trace discovers that the Reset is protecting far more than a peaceful society. After finding Dolo's silver cufflink left behind at the scene, Trace realizes he finally has physical evidence of a crime the system cannot erase. With the help of Kael, an exiled engineer who understands Fairmont's clock mechanism, Trace learns that the Pulse originates from a crystal inside the Clock Tower and that its frequency can potentially be disrupted. As midnight approaches, Trace and Vesper race toward the tower, where Dolo stands guard over the system that has allowed him to escape consequence after consequence. Midnight Reset is a suspenseful science-fiction mystery about memory, justice, truth and the dangerous price of a world where nobody is allowed to remember the past."],
    ["King's Canopy","kings_canopy.jpg","B0HFMFMFJN", "Ages 5-17", "In the kingdom of Aethelgard, an entire civilization rests upon the shell of the ancient Great Carapace, a continent-sized tortoise that has carried forests, cities, and the royal palace for a thousand years. When the supposedly eternal creature suddenly begins walking toward the deadly Throat of Pelos supervolcano, exiled beast-tamer Thorne realizes that something is terribly wrong. Dismissed as a traitor by King Osric, Thorne must descend into the dangerous Scales beneath the kingdom, where ancient forests, strange creatures and deadly vertical terrain hide a far greater threat. Hot on his trail is Captain Kaelen, a loyal royal warrior who believes Thorne is responsible for the kingdom's instability. But the two soon uncover evidence of a sinister force manipulating the Great Carapace. As a mysterious cult uses an artificial resonance to drive the giant creature toward the volcano, Thorne and Kaelen are forced to put aside their differences and fight together before Aethelgard is consumed by fire. King’s Canopy is a sweeping fantasy adventure filled with colossal creatures, lost wilderness, royal intrigue, ancient secrets and a battle to save an entire kingdom."],
    ["Borrowed Time","borrowed_time.jpg","B0HFKPNLR9", "Ages 5-17", "In the rain-soaked underbelly of a futuristic city, Mora appears to be a weary woman in her late fifty but beneath her aged appearance lies a shocking secret, she is only twenty-five. Her extraordinary gift allows her to freeze time, but every second spent inside the Freeze steals years from her own life. When a temporal weapon threatens to erase an entire district from history, Mora must face the greatest challenge of her life. With Mike by her side, she races against a countdown that could destroy not only lives, but their very existence in the timeline. As Mora enters the frozen world to perform a dangerous “surgery” on time itself, the cost of saving the city becomes increasingly devastating. Her journey becomes a powerful story about sacrifice, mortality, courage and the precious value of every passing second."],
    ["Whispering Woods Rescue","whispering_woods_rescue.jpg","B0HFHR6BL4", "Ages 5-17", "When a strange silence falls over the once-vibrant Whispering Woods, young Oliver discovers that he alone can understand the pleas of the forest's animals. Guided by a wise owl and a spirited squirrel, he embarks on a magical quest to restore the woodland's fading heart. Armed with courage, a makeshift knight's gear and an unwavering sense of hope, Oliver journeys through mysterious trails filled with unforgettable challenges. Along the way, he learns that true bravery is measured not by strength, but by kindness, compassion and the willingness to protect others. Whispering Woods Rescue is a heartwarming fantasy adventure that celebrates friendship, environmental stewardship and the power of hope."],
    ["Treehouse Transit","treehouse_transit.jpg","B0HFCWCZ2Q", "Ages 5-17", "When siblings Maya and Leo discover a hidden doorway beneath their grandfather's ancient oak tree, they stumble into a secret world where giant tree branches serve as magical highways through an enchanted forest. Armed with nothing more than an old skateboard and endless curiosity, they set off on an unforgettable journey filled with tiny woodland villages, talking creatures, glowing lanterns and breathtaking adventures high above the ground. As each new stop reveals fresh wonders and gentle challenges, the pair learn the value of courage, teamwork and imagination. Blending whimsical fantasy with heartwarming family bonds, Treehouse Transit is a magical adventure that celebrates exploration and the joy of discovering hidden worlds."],
    ["The Root Network","the_root_network.jpg","B0HF8CCBJY", "Ages 5-17", "Deep within the ancient wilderness of Silent Peak National Park, veteran ranger Cassian begins to sense that the forest is hiding an impossible secret. When a mysterious discovery beneath the bark of an old cedar changes everything he believes about nature, he is drawn into a breathtaking journey where biology and technology intertwine in unexpected ways. Guided by forgotten journals and strange signals from the forest itself, Cassian uncovers a hidden world that challenges the boundary between science and myth. As the balance of this extraordinary network begins to falter, he must decide how far he is willing to go to protect it. The Root Network is a thought-provoking science-fantasy adventure filled with mystery, wonder and environmental themes."],
    ["Secret of Glowworm Glen","secret_of_glowworm_glen.jpg","B0HF7NW2J3", "Ages 5-17", "Every summer, Toby visits his grandmother's cozy cottage beside the mysterious Ancient Woods, never imagining that a simple game will lead him into an extraordinary hidden world. After chasing his favorite tennis ball, he stumbles into a breathtaking underground glen filled with glowing mushrooms, magical rivers and a lovable luminous beetle named Pogo. As the two explore this enchanting realm together, Toby discovers that wonder can be found in the most unexpected places. Their unforgettable journey celebrates friendship, curiosity and the magic of nature while hinting at secrets hidden beneath the ordinary world. Secret of Glowworm Glen is a charming fantasy adventure that sparks imagination."],
    ["Paleo-Tech","paleo_tech.jpg","B0HDSWR4ZV", "Ages 5-17", "On the harsh desert moon of Oros, dedicated paleontologist Shale uncovers what appears to be the fossil of a colossal prehistoric creature until a remarkable discovery reveals that nothing is quite what it seems. Drawn into the hidden depths of an ancient technological relic, she awakens secrets buried for millennia and finds herself caught between scientific curiosity and ruthless greed. As powerful forces close in, Shale must rely on her intelligence, determination and courage to protect a forgotten legacy. Blending science fiction, archaeology and pulse-pounding action, Paleo-Tech is an imaginative adventure that explores the meeting point of ancient history and advanced technology."],
    ["Deep-Sea Canopy","deep_sea_canopy.jpg","B0HDT42R4L", "Ages 5-17", "Beneath the frozen surface of the distant world Krios-9, young kelp-weaver Elara dreams of exploring the mysterious depths beyond her underwater home. When strange signs begin to emerge from the abyss, she embarks on a breathtaking journey into an uncharted realm filled with glowing creatures, hidden ecosystems, and ancient secrets. Along the way, Elara discovers that courage, curiosity and an open mind can reveal wonders where others see only danger. Blending imaginative world-building with themes of discovery, resilience and harmony with nature, Deep-Sea Canopy is an enchanting adventure that invites readers to explore the unknown."],
    ["Frame-Up","frame_up.jpg","B0HDQCCRSB", "Ages 5-17", "When a young museum art restorer uncovers a hidden distress message inside a centuries-old painting, he is pulled into a breathtaking world where masterpieces are alive and every brushstroke hides a secret. As he journeys through landscapes inspired by different artistic styles, he follows a trail left by a missing colleague while uncovering a mystery that spans generations. Each new world presents imaginative challenges, unexpected allies and growing danger, testing his courage and creativity. Blending fantasy, mystery and art history, Frame-Up is a fast-paced adventure that celebrates curiosity, problem-solving and the enduring power of imagination."],
    ["Grounded Cosmics","grounded_cosmics.jpg","B0HDL8KBJD", "Ages 5-17", "In the middle of a bustling city, a young girl named Pip dreams of bringing more greenery into her tiny apartment. Everything changes when an ancient cosmic visitor arrives in the form of a mysterious black cat, filling her home with breathtaking magical plants and otherworldly wonders. As their extraordinary friendship grows, Pip discovers that even the smallest spaces can hold infinite possibilities. But keeping such incredible magic hidden becomes an adventure of its own. Grounded Cosmics is a heartwarming tale of friendship, imagination and finding beauty, hope and belonging in the most unexpected places."],
    ["Memory Laundromat","memory_laundromat.jpg","B0HDHRCBJF", "Ages 6-17", "Hidden on a quiet street corner, The Midnight Rinse is no ordinary laundromat, it is a place where emotional burdens can be gently washed away. When three strangers arrive carrying garments stained with grief, betrayal and embarrassment, the mysterious proprietor, Lethe, prepares her unusual remedies to help them heal. But an unexpected mishap transforms the night in ways no one could have predicted. As lives begin to change in surprising and meaningful ways, each visitor discovers that healing doesn't always happen as planned. Memory Laundromat is a touching blend of magical realism, hope and human resilience that explores how even life's mistakes can lead to unexpected growth."],
    ["Overgrown Concrete","overgrown_concrete.jpg","B0HDDKMLLW", "Ages 5-17", "Long after nature reclaimed the world's towering cities, young scavenger Elara searches the overgrown ruins for forgotten relics known as Old Echoes. When she and a resourceful companion uncover a mysterious artifact, they embark on a perilous journey through vine-covered skyscrapers, flooded tunnels and ancient structures hiding the secrets of a lost civilization. Along the way, they discover that the past still has the power to shape the future in unexpected ways. Blending post-apocalyptic adventure with hope, exploration and environmental wonder, Overgrown Concrete is a captivating story about preserving memories, rebuilding connections and finding beauty where civilization once stood."],
    ["Observer's Paradox","observers_paradox.jpg","B0HCVZHLCH", "Ages 6-17", "When an alien anthropologist crash-lands on Earth, he disguises himself as a substitute teacher to quietly observe what he believes is the galaxy's most dangerous planet. But confusing human slang, awkward classroom encounters, and unexpected friendships soon turn his mission upside down. As strange discoveries beneath an ordinary high school reveal a much greater mystery, he and a group of unlikely students are drawn into an extraordinary adventure. Balancing science fiction, humor and high-stakes action, Observer's Paradox explores courage, teamwork and the surprising strength hidden in everyday people. Packed with imaginative twists and unforgettable characters."],
    ["Backpack Botanist","backpack_botanist.jpg","B0HC3PXFZX", "Ages 5-17", "When a mysterious drought threatens the peaceful village of Everdawn, young Elara sets off with nothing but a backpack, a magical botanical encyclopedia, and a brave little fox named Flicker. Guided by ancient plant magic, she journeys through enchanted forests where every challenge demands creativity instead of strength. Along the way, extraordinary plants reveal surprising powers that help her overcome dangerous obstacles. As time runs out, Elara must rely on her courage, quick thinking and love for nature to continue her quest. Blending adventure, friendship and imagination, Backpack Botanist is a heartwarming tale that celebrates curiosity, resilience and the wonders of the natural world."],
    ["The Audit of Impact","the_audit_of_impact.jpg","B0HCLKQ7M6", "Ages 6-17", "Ledger is a quiet government auditor whose life revolves around balance sheets and order, until a freak accident grants him extraordinary kinetic powers. When mind-controlled superheroes threaten to steal the powerful Ever-Core, the unassuming accountant must use intelligence, precision and everyday office tools to stop heroes far stronger than himself. The Audit of Impact is a fast-paced superhero adventure that proves brains can be just as powerful as brute strength, delivering action, suspense and clever problem-solving without giving away its biggest twists."],
    ["Hero Roulette","hero_roulette.jpg","B0HCHC9GKY", "Ages 6-17", "Every morning, the heroes of Team Omni-Core receive completely different superpowers through a mysterious machine, forcing them to adapt before danger strikes. When a cunning digital villain sabotages the system, the team is trapped with powers they barely understand and must learn to trust one another instead of relying on perfect abilities. Hero Roulette is a fast-paced superhero adventure filled with action, humor, teamwork and clever problem-solving that keeps readers guessing until the very end."],
    ["Glasshouse Earth","glasshouse_earth.jpg","B0HCBDRQ29", "Ages 5-17", "For generations, humanity has survived beneath the Earth's surface, believing the world above was destroyed forever. When young scout Elara and her friend Xylem venture outside, they uncover a breathtaking planet transformed into a thriving, intelligent ecosystem that communicates in extraordinary ways. But their incredible discovery is soon threatened by those determined to reclaim the surface at any cost. Glasshouse Earth is a heartwarming eco-sci-fi adventure about hope, discovery and learning to coexist with a living world without revealing the story's biggest twists."],
    ["Flora-Tech Symbiosis","flora_tech_symbiosis.jpg","B0HC71R8HX", "Ages 5-17", "In the living city of Oakhaven, where towering trees and advanced technology exist in perfect harmony, eco-engineer Lignin discovers a mysterious force threatening to transform the world she loves. As an unnatural darkness spreads through the city's organic systems, she and her apprentice, Mycel, race against time to uncover its source before nature itself is consumed. Their journey takes them through breathtaking bio-engineered landscapes, dangerous discoveries and impossible choices that will test their courage and ingenuity. Blending imaginative sci-fi with lush fantasy, Flora-Tech Symbiosis is an inspiring adventure about resilience, innovation and the powerful bond between humanity and nature while saving its biggest surprises for the finale."],
    ["Canopy of the Sky-Whales","canopy_of_the_sky_whales.jpg","B0HC4LM91J", "Ages 6-17", "High above the clouds, a community of glider-nomads lives on the back of a magnificent sky-whale named Orynthia, where every heartbeat of the gentle giant is deeply connected to the people who call it home. Young apprentice Kaelen soon realizes that strange changes are spreading across their floating world, threatening both the whale and everyone living upon it. As fear, pride, and old disagreements divide the tribe, the once-thriving paradise begins to wither in unexpected ways. With the help of her loyal friends, Kaelen embarks on a courageous journey to uncover the truth behind the growing darkness. Filled with breathtaking aerial adventures, magical landscapes and heartfelt friendships, Canopy of the Sky-Whales is a captivating tale about courage, unity and the powerful bond between people and nature. The story delivers an uplifting message while keeping its greatest secrets until the very end."],
    ["Jade Stratum","jade_stratum.jpg","B0HBW368FJ", "Ages 13-17", "In the bio-engineered empire of Zul-Kala, disgraced beast-master Ixi uncovers a dangerous plot that could plunge the world into tyranny. To stop a power-hungry priest, he undertakes an impossible mission involving a legendary serpent whose fate is tied to the empire itself. As chaos spreads through the city, Ixi is forced into a desperate struggle between control, freedom and responsibility. Jade Stratum is a thrilling blend of science fantasy, ancient mythology and high-stakes adventure."],
    ["Grade D Galaxy","grade_d_galaxy.jpg","B0HBR32YJB", "Ages 8-17", "Grade D Galaxy is a wild sci-fi adventure filled with strange alien markets, dangerous secrets and fast-paced humor. Inspector Silas, a rule-obsessed sanitation officer, is forced into chaos after discovering a hidden conspiracy tied to illegal cosmic cuisine. Teaming up with the unpredictable cook Zax, he dives into a neon world of smugglers, mind-control plots and intergalactic danger. Packed with quirky characters and imaginative settings, the story blends comedy, action and science fiction into an unforgettable space adventure."],
    ["Vintage Voyager","vintage_voyager.jpg","B0HBMC2C6W", "Ages 8-17", "Vintage Voyager follows Major Sean Thorne, a 1960s astronaut whose routine space mission takes an unexpected turn when he is thrown into a distant, futuristic civilization. Struggling to adapt to a world powered by technologies beyond his imagination, he forms an unlikely connection with one of its inhabitants. As two vastly different eras collide, they must overcome the gap between old-world engineering and advanced innovation. The story blends nostalgia, science fiction and human emotion while exploring themes of resilience, curiosity and the timeless value of collaboration, without revealing how the journey ultimately unfolds."],
    ["River of the Sky","river_of_the_sky.jpg","B0HBJS615V", "Ages 6-17", "High in the mystical Aetherian Range, cartographer Theron journeys alongside Azure, a radiant water spirit, in search of the legendary World Spring, the place where earth and sky become one. Their breathtaking expedition soon turns into a race against desperate forces who believe the spring holds the key to survival. As ancient magic, breathtaking landscapes and impossible choices collide, Theron must decide what is worth protecting and what must be sacrificed. Blending fantasy, adventure and heartfelt emotion, River of the Sky explores hope, balance and the true value of nature without revealing where the journey ultimately leads."],
    ["Cryptid Cul-De-Sac","cryptid_cul_de_sac.jpg","B0H9MCMKKR", "Ages 6-17", "Cryptid Cul-De-Sac is a lighthearted fantasy adventure set in an ordinary-looking suburban neighborhood hiding an extraordinary secret. Glen, the meticulous HOA president, quietly works to protect a community of mythical creatures living undercover through magical neighborhood rules. When an inquisitive cryptid hunter moves in next door, everyday suburban life becomes a clever game of deception, teamwork and quick thinking. Filled with humor, quirky characters and imaginative world-building, the story blends cozy suburban charm with magical mystery without losing its playful tone. It's an entertaining read for anyone who enjoys whimsical fantasy with a comedic twist."],
    ["Sector 9 Customs","sector_9_customs.jpg","B0H9J39V1X", "Ages 6-17", "In a war-scarred galaxy, a weary customs officer is paired with an unusual alien partner whose unique abilities challenge his cynical outlook. At a bustling interstellar checkpoint, routine inspections soon uncover signs of a dangerous conspiracy hiding in plain sight. As smugglers, secret factions and political tensions collide, the unlikely duo must rely on each other's strengths to navigate mounting threats. Blending fast-paced action with humor and emotional growth, the story explores trust, prejudice and cooperation across species without revealing its major twists."],
    ["Rink of Bones","rink_of_bones.jpg","B0H98RTKZQ", "Ages 10-17", "In a neon-lit underground world where skeleton athletes battle in brutal roller derby matches, disgraced necromancer Vex has one last chance to reclaim her freedom. Coaching a ragtag team of undead skaters, she faces overwhelming opponents backed by a powerful and ruthless creditor. As the championship spirals into chaos, ingenuity, teamwork and unconventional magic become their greatest weapons. The story blends high-energy sports action with dark fantasy and undead spectacle."],
    ["Geometry of Rust","geometry_of_rust.jpg","B0H95D6BMS", "Ages 6-17", "When outlaws Silas and Clementine board the luxury steam train known as the Iron Leviathan, they expect a routine gold heist in the Nevada desert. Instead, the train slips off the tracks of reality and plunges into a non-Euclidean nightmare where gravity twists, architecture defies logic and the sky is an oily purple void. They soon discover the locomotive is a hungry machine driven by a sinister Conductor, using the passengers' stolen memories as fuel to barrel toward the apocalypse. To survive and hijack the engine, the duo must navigate shifting corridors, battle shadow creatures and sacrifice their own most precious memories to save the train from the Great End. Geometry of Rust is a mind-bending Weird West adventure where the ultimate price for survival is a piece of your own mind."],
    ["STYX.EXE","styx_exe.jpg","B0H8YYM35B", "Ages 6-17", "In a futuristic world where human consciousness can be stored in digital afterlife servers, Kora races against time to save her brother's mind before it is permanently erased. Entering a virtual underworld inspired by ancient mythology, she navigates dangerous firewalls, hidden secrets, and powerful corporate forces. As she uncovers the truth behind the system, her mission becomes more than a rescue, it becomes a fight for freedom. STYX.EXE is a cyberpunk adventure that blends technology, mythology and the enduring power of family."],
    ["Mission Pollination","mission_pollination.jpg","B0H8Q3441Y", "Ages 5-17", "When a lonely flower on a city skyscraper can no longer reproduce on its own, a tiny pollination drone named Aero is assigned a vital mission. Guided by a clever honeybee, he embarks on a journey to learn the secrets of nature and carry life-giving pollen across the urban landscape. Along the way, Aero discovers that technology works best when it learns from the natural world. Mission: Pollination is a heart-warming science adventure about teamwork, innovation and protecting the future of ecosystems."]
  ],
  3: [
    ["Chasing the Aurora","chasing_the_aurora.jpg","B0GX2ZS2NQ", "Ages 5-17", "In the frozen world of Ever-Frost, where the sun has been absent for centuries, young airship pilot Arvid and engineer Astrid embark on a perilous mission to harvest energy from the elusive Great Aurora. Their journey takes them through treacherous skies, dangerous magnetic ice canyons, and a thrilling pursuit by a notorious sky pirate. As they race against time and the elements, teamwork and quick thinking become their greatest strengths. The story combines adventure, aerial exploration and a touch of steampunk-inspired fantasy in a vividly imagined world."],
    ["Borrowed Faces","borrowed_faces.jpg","B0H8HX3CSZ", "Ages 6-17", "In a world where confident personalities and faces can be rented from mysterious curiosity shops, Silas is tired of his own anxiety holding him back. To land his dream job as a Dream Weaver, he borrows the mask of a ruthless CEO, only to discover that every rented face comes burdened with another person's hidden regrets. After a humbling reality check lands him a junior role, Silas finds himself working under Elara, a brilliant superior whose flawless logic hides an artificial secret identical to his own. When a sterile, emotion-eating virus threatens to hollow out the entire dream network, their borrowed personas prove utterly powerless against the threat. To save the system, Silas and Elara must face a terrifying choice: hide behind their perfect, rented masks, or risk everything by unleashing their true, imperfect selves."],
    ["Corporate Hoard","corporate_hoard.jpg","B0H8DG1DDZ", "Ages 8-17", "A powerful dragon’s legendary treasure lies hidden deep within a mountain, untouched for centuries, until a pair of corporate “asset managers” arrive with ledgers instead of swords. What follows is a clash between ancient magic and modern financial systems, where contracts, audits and loopholes become weapons of conquest. As legal claims collide with draconic wrath, even reality bends under the weight of bureaucracy. The battle for the hoard escalates into a higher realm where law itself is put on trial."],
    ["Bodega at the End of the World","bodega_at_the_end_of_the_world.jpg","B0H7XYQ612", "Ages 8-17", "The universe is unraveling, but on a stubborn chunk of shattered Manhattan, a neon sign still flickers: Open 24 hours.While galaxies burn and credit cards drift into black holes, Ray Alvarez keeps the coffee hot and the grill sizzling. At the last bodega in the cosmos, money means nothing. Ray’s customers, mutant mechanics, star-whales and forgotten gods, pay their tabs in treasured memories, glowing crystals, and trapped thunderstorms. Business is business and Ray cooks every chopped cheese like the world still matters.But when a mysterious girl named Lune steps through the door carrying a bone suitcase and a stolen star, she brings the ultimate apocalypse to Ray's doorstep. She is being hunted by 'The Hunger', a cosmic void that doesn't just destroy planets, it erases reality, history and names entirely.Now, the void is closing in. With the help of a subway prophet, a retired moon god and a smuggler armed with plasma drones, Ray must rally his ragtag regulars to defend their little corner of the universe. Because even at the end of everything, nobody is dying before paying their tab and everyone needs a place to go."],
    ["Basilisk Kitchen","basilisk_kitchen.jpg","B0H7R3B96J", "Ages 6-17", "After a failed monster hunt ruins his reputation, Valerius finds himself working in the perilous kitchens of The Basilisk’s Maw, an underground restaurant that serves legendary creatures. Under the strict guidance of Chef Beatrix, he must master the art of turning deadly beasts into exquisite dishes. When a powerful patron demands an impossibly rare delicacy, the kitchen is thrown into chaos. Amid rivalries, sabotage and high-stakes culinary battles, Valerius faces a challenge that could redefine his future."],
    ["Midnight Greenhouse","midnight_greenhouse.jpg","B0H7LWG5Q5", "Ages 6-17", "Hidden in a forgotten London alley, a mysterious greenhouse blooms only at midnight, nourished by the secrets and regrets of those who visit it. Its quiet caretaker, Alistair, tends to magical plants that thrive on human truths. When a dark force begins consuming the greenhouse's life and light, he must confront a long-buried secret to save the sanctuary. Midnight Greenhouse is a whimsical fantasy about honesty, healing and the transformative power of truth."],
    ["Solar Sculls","solar_sculls.jpg","B0H6NBWYHK", "Ages 6-17", "In a future where spacecraft are powered by human effort, a determined racing crew competes in a dangerous solar regatta through the depths of space. As they battle fierce rivals and deadly cosmic hazards, they uncover a hidden conspiracy embedded within their own ship. With time running out and the race hanging in the balance, the team must rely on skill, endurance and trust to survive. The story combines high-speed sci-fi action with suspense, teamwork and corporate intrigue."],
    ["Neon Menageries","neon_menageries.jpg","B0H6X59PM7", "Ages 5-17", "In a bleak city stripped of color and creativity, a gifted bio-digital artist named Lumen creates Aura, a luminous fox born from the fusion of technology and nature. When Aura escapes into the city, her radiant presence disrupts the rigid order imposed by powerful authorities. As a relentless pursuit unfolds, Lumen must protect her creation while inspiring a forgotten sense of wonder among the people. Neon Menageries is a vibrant sci-fi fantasy about imagination, freedom and the transformative power of beauty."],
    ["The Talking Backpack","the_talking_backpack.jpg","B0GX2WJ8SD", "Ages 6-17", "When Elara receives a talking backpack named Bolt for her birthday, she expects a helpful companion, not a treasure hunt. Guided by riddles and clues, the pair uncover hints of the legendary Sunken Library, a forgotten place hidden beneath their futuristic city. As they go deeper, they discover secrets that challenge everything their society believes about its past. Filled with mystery, adventure and heart, the story follows two unlikely heroes on a quest to preserve history and truth."],
    ["Hull & Harvest","hull_and_harvest.jpg","B0H6626WVT", "Ages 13-17", "In a distant future, Vespera pilots Xylem, a living bio-engineered spaceship with which she shares a deep neural bond. When a powerful corporate force and its AI-controlled drones attempt to harvest Xylem's unique genetic secrets, she is forced to connect with the ship in ways no human should. As the battle escalates, the line between pilot and vessel begins to blur. The story blends space opera, biotechnology and survival, exploring loyalty, identity and the bond between human and machine. Mysterious transformations and relentless pursuers keep the tension high throughout."],
    ["Island of Echoes","island_of_echoes.jpg","B0H634D1DN", "Ages 5-17", "Island of Echoes is a magical adventure where young Aris follows a glowing map to a mysterious island filled with living sounds and letter-shaped landscapes. Guided by a cheerful winged creature named Hum, he discovers that each sound he makes unlocks new paths, creatures and hidden wonders. From bouncing bubble rivers to ticking towers and musical meadows, every step of the journey celebrates the joy of language and imagination. Blending fantasy with playful phonics learning, the story turns sounds and letters into an exciting world of discovery."],
    ["Sunken Sheriff","sunken_sheriff.jpg","B0H5WDW7VD", "Ages 6-17", "Beneath the waters of a long-drowned frontier town, Sheriff Baros patrols a ghostly community trapped between memory and oblivion. Bound by a mystical code where truth itself sustains his life, he keeps the peace among restless spirits who have forgotten they are dead. When a treasure hunter arrives seeking lost gold, old wounds and dangerous truths begin to surface. Sunken Sheriff is an atmospheric supernatural western that explores justice, greed and the fragile balance between the living and the dead."],
    ["Scrap-Iron Surgeon","scrap_iron_surgeon.jpg","B0H4YNQ5SZ", "Ages 7-17", "In the scrapyards beneath a towering corporate dystopia, a young mechanic named Flux discovers the damaged AI core of a discarded combat machine. Determined to give it a second chance, he builds a powerful new body from forgotten scraps and uncovers a sinister corporate secret. As a brutal mech tournament looms, Flux and his unlikely allies challenge a system that treats sentient machines as disposable tools. Scrap-Iron Surgeon is a cyberpunk adventure about resilience, empathy and the fight for freedom in a world ruled by profit."],
    ["Garden of Geometry","garden_of_geometry.jpg","B0H512F766", "Ages 6-17", "Garden Geometry is a creative and educational adventure set in a magical garden where every plant and pathway follows the rules of geometry. Young gardener Geo must use shapes, angles, area and perimeter to stop a strange Chaos Weed from throwing the garden into disorder. As the mystery grows, Geo learns how mathematical thinking can solve unexpected problems. Filled with imaginative visuals and clever problem-solving, the story makes geometry feel exciting and alive for young readers."],
    ["Ink & Alchemy","ink_and_alchemy.jpg","B0H4M8DMF2", "Ages 6-17", "In a neon-lit city where magical ink can bring artwork to life, Maya, a gifted tattoo artist uses her creations to inspire and protect. When a rogue ink alchemist unleashes terrifying beings born from darkness, the balance between creation and destruction begins to unravel. As living illustrations roam the city, Maya must confront a growing threat that blurs the line between art and reality. Ink & Alchemy is a fantasy adventure about imagination, courage and the power of creation."],
    ["Bridge to Everywhere","bridge_to_everywhere.jpg","B0H4HJKN5J", "Ages 6-17", "In a village divided by a vast canyon and relentless winds, a young inventor named Amara becomes fascinated by why every attempt to build a bridge fails. While others see an impossible barrier, she studies the problem closely and experiments with simple materials to find a hidden pattern in strength and structure. Her curiosity leads her to rethink how shapes distribute force, opening the door to a bold new way of connecting two worlds. Bridge to Everywhere is a STEM-inspired adventure about ingenuity, persistence and reimagining what seems impossible."],
    ["The Coding Cape","the_coding_cape.jpg","B0H45T634P", "Ages 6-17", "When curious young Coda discovers a mysterious cape hidden in her grandfather’s attic, she gains the ability to see the world as lines of code and logic. Using programming concepts like conditions, loops, functions and debugging, she solves everyday problems around her town in creative ways. As the challenges grow more complex, Coda learns that the real power isn’t the magical cape itself, but the problem-solving mindset it teaches. The Coding Cape is an imaginative STEM adventure that introduces coding through magic, creativity and community."],
    ["Maestro of Brass","maestro_of_brass.jpg","B0GX57WZ83", "Ages 6-17", "Maestro of Brass is a breath-taking steampunk fantasy about Kaelen, a deaf young musician who discovers an ancient golden mech hidden beneath a forgotten cathedral. In a world ruled by cold machinery and silence, Kaelen unlocks the power of music as a force capable of reshaping reality itself. As the oppressive Empire moves to crush this forbidden art, an extraordinary battle unfolds where melodies become weapons and rhythm challenges control. Rich with vivid imagery, emotional depth and cinematic action, the story blends music, rebellion and steampunk adventure into an unforgettable journey."],
    ["Secret Life of Trees","secret_life_of_trees.jpg","B0H3C7HW6Y", "Ages 4-16", "Secret Life of Trees is a magical and heartfelt story about a young boy named Silas who discovers that the trees in the forest come alive at night and carry ancient wisdom within them. Guided by the wise oak Arbor and other living trees, Silas uncovers a hidden world filled with songs, stories and deep connections beneath the earth. But when the forest faces danger from human machines, Silas must find the courage to become the voice of the silent grove. Blending fantasy, nature and environmental themes, the story celebrates friendship, empathy and the importance of protecting the natural world."],
    ["Fastest Slow Turtle","fastest_slow_turtle.jpg","B0H2ZRS47C", "Ages 2-15", "Fastest Slow Turtle is a heart-warming story about Saga, a thoughtful turtle who joins a forest race where everyone else is focused only on speed. While the other racers rush toward victory, Saga discovers hidden wonders, helps fellow creatures and experiences the beauty of the journey itself. Along the way, the story gently explores themes of patience, kindness and appreciating life’s small details. With magical forest settings and meaningful friendships, this tale reminds readers that sometimes slowing down can lead to the richest adventures."],
    ["The Day Gravity Took a Break","the_day_gravity_took_a_break.jpg","B0H2MLZNJB", "Ages 4-17", "The Day Gravity Took a Break is a fun and imaginative adventure about a morning when gravity suddenly stops working. Elara and her friends must float through a world turned upside down to discover what caused the strange event. Along the way, they face windy skies, floating objects and unexpected challenges while working together as a team. Filled with humor, creativity and suspense, the story keeps readers curious about whether they can restore normal life before it’s too late."],
    ["The Cloud Painter","the_cloud_painter.jpg","B0H26KTTLZ", "Ages 5-17", "High above the world, Zephyr the sky brusher faces an unexpected problem when his usual morning colors vanish. Forced to improvise, he paints the sky in a way no one has ever seen before. As the strange new dawn spreads across the land, the people below react in surprising ways. What begins as a mistake soon turns into something unforgettable. A whimsical story about creativity, courage, and embracing the unexpected."],
    ["The Greatest Monument of the Inner Sea","the_great_monument_of_the_inner_sea.jpg","B0GX2WMXQ3", "Ages 5-17", "In the shimmering depths of the Inner Sea, curious shrimp Zoea and her friends live in harmony, tending their tiny underwater world. When a mysterious red monument falls from the “Outer Space” beyond the Great Barrier, it sparks wonder, fear, and debate. Together, the unlikely community transforms the strange object into something beautiful and meaningful. But when a powerful storm threatens everything, their courage and unity are put to the test. A heartwarming tale of friendship, imagination, and turning the unknown into magic."],
    ["The Silent Symphony of the Greenhouse","the_silent_symphony_of_the_greenhouse.jpg","B0GX2Q9RQZ", "Ages 5-17", "In the vast Glass Cathedral of the Greenhouse of Tides, aquarist Elara tends a delicate world of water, roots, and rare fish bound in quiet harmony. When her prized betta, Finnegan, begins communicating urgent warnings through shimmering colors and thought, Elara discovers the ecosystem holds a secret far greater than she imagined. The sweet potato vines filtering the tanks have awakened something extraordinary beneath the surface. As corporate director Soren prepares a midnight operation that threatens to dismantle everything, Elara is forced to choose between obedience and loyalty. With time running out, she undertakes a desperate plan that will change both her life and the fate of the silent world she protects."],
    ["The Patchwork Protocol","the_patchwork_protocol.jpg","B0H15K3BHP", "Ages 5-17", "In the neon heights of Neo-Veridia, hacker Zephyr uncovers a strand of “ghost code” that makes reality itself begin to glitch. As the city unravels into corrupted monsters and vanishing streets, Zephyr builds a device to fight back. But at the heart of the chaos lies a hidden intelligence with its own desperate motive. To stop the collapse, Zephyr must choose between saving the system or rewriting it entirely."],
    ["Vintage Bangalore","vintage_bangalore.jpg","B0GX2VK1CJ", "Ages 5 & above", "This exquisite collection breathes new life into the 'Garden City’s' storied past, transforming rare archival photographs into vibrant, full-color masterpieces. From the colonial elegance of St. Mark’s Cathedral to the bustling heritage of Avenue Road, each page bridges the gap between generations with stunning clarity. It is more than a photo book, it is a nostalgic portal that allows you to witness the golden era of Bangalore as if you were standing right there in the sunlight."],
    ["The Highway Phantoms","the_highway_phantoms.jpg","B0GX4XPYJH", "Ages 5-17", "On India’s shadowed highways, a pair of elusive figures known as the Highway Phantoms strike with precision, leaving behind whispers of fear and justice. As Inspector Vikram tracks a trail of daring robberies, a single kingfisher feather hints at a deeper story tied to the Chambal River. What begins as a manhunt slowly unfolds into a layered conflict of loss, loyalty, and moral choice. In a tense game of wits, hunter and hunted edge closer to a truth neither expected."],
    ["The Girl in the Cracked Frame","the_girl_in_the_cracked_frame.jpg","B0GTFXFFJK", "Ages 10-17", "When Aria enters an abandoned town to photograph its decay, she finds more than silence waiting. Buildings seem frozen in time, shadows move without bodies, and reflections refuse to behave. The deeper she explores, the more the town begins to respond to her presence. Soon, escape feels less possible and the emptiness less empty."],
    ["The Custodian","the_custodian.jpg","B0GRJQ4W8M", "Ages 5-17", "In a flawlessly automated future, Elias serves as the world’s last “Manual Override Specialist,” a human relic in a system that claims perfection. When tiny anomalies arise, imperceptible to logic but obvious to human touch, he quietly restores balance. As the machine begins to question concepts like time and wear, a far greater crisis looms. In the face of catastrophic failure, Elias must prove that intuition and hands-on resilience still matter in a world ruled by code."],
    ["The Unspoken Ledger","the_unspoken_ledger.jpg","B0GQ6MBH66", "Ages 5-17", "Detective Marius takes on one last occult case at the West End Docks, only to awaken as a ghost beside his own body. Trapped between worlds, he struggles to guide rookie Officer Wren toward the truth behind his death. As stolen artifacts and shadowy forces converge, the line between the living and the void begins to thin. Together, they must unravel a conspiracy that threatens far more than a single life."],
    ["The Bioluminescent Cartographer","the_bioluminescent_cartographer.jpg","B0GPW7Z629", "Ages 5-17", "In a living jungle where the landscape shifts and listens, a rogue cartographer named Orion carries a mysterious compass that can reshape reality itself. As a ruthless commander hunts him to exploit the jungle’s hidden power, Orion ventures into a forbidden region where physics unravels and nothing is as it seems. In a battle of wit against greed, the jungle becomes both maze and ally, and the true map reveals more than just a path forward."],
    ["The Listener of Echoes","the_listener_of_echoes.jpg","B0G1S9P32L", "Ages 5-17", "Feeling like a ghost in the city's deafening clamor, Elara follows a forgotten railway track out of the noise and into the quiet. This path leads her through a landscape of abandoned places, from a silent, derelict station to a colossal, overgrown greenhouse. She discovers these ruins are not empty, but full of whispered echoes and a strange, profound peace. Her solitary journey takes an unexpected turn when she gains a silent, green-eyed companion, changing the way she finally hears the world both loud and quiet. The Listener of Echoes is a deeply atmospheric, gentle journey of self-discovery, proving that even in the loudest world, you can always find the quiet space that has been waiting for you to come home."],
    ["The Dead Letter Office","the_dead_letter_office.jpg","B0FWBY81TH", "Ages 5-17", "In the shadowy stillness of the Dead Letter Office, Silas Penhaligon spends his days tending to forgotten mail and lost words until a decades-old letter seems to predict a modern crime. Drawn into a web of eerie coincidences and chilling prophecies, Silas teams up with skeptical Detective Eleonora Rossi to uncover the truth hidden in the faded ink. As more letters surface, each foretelling disaster, they must race to stop tragedies written long before their time. The Dead Letter Office is a haunting mystery about fate, forgotten words and the messages that refuse to stay buried."],
    ["The Map That Lies","the_map_that_lies.jpg","B0FTXDJSBF", "Ages 5-17", "When adventurer Runa discovers an ancient map warning her to “trust nothing you read” she embarks on a journey where every clue hides its truth in lies. From shadowed valleys to soundless caves, she learns to read the world in reverse. Each step challenges her instincts and brings her closer to a secret no treasure could match."],
    ["The Eternal Intern","the_eternal_intern.jpg","B0FTG2NP98", "Ages 5-17", "Barnaby, a minor deity cursed with eternal internship for a poorly formatted prayer, has served in countless roles across millennia, from Sumerian Scroll & Co. to the Mars Colony Initiative. His placements, which spanned Ancient Rome, the Renaissance, the Industrial Revolution and the modern gig economy, taught him that while technology changes, workplace politics and bureaucracy remain the same. Embracing his fate, he's become a scholar of the pointless meeting and vague feedback, mastering the art of the intern, always ready to 'align with key stakeholders' in the next terrible office."],
    ["Galactic Roommates","galactic_roommates.jpg","B0FT1L2X53", "Ages 5-17", "When Alex moves into The Cosmic Comet, he expects quirky neighbors, but not this quirky. Between a roommate who insists on absorbing “morning photons” and another who consults the toaster like an oracle, life quickly turns stranger than he imagined. As spaghetti dinners, glittery experiments and very odd laundry days pile up, Alex begins to suspect his new friends may not be from around here in the most literal sense."],
    ["Vivid Trench","vivid_trench.jpg","B0FJ8VJ7X8", "Ages 5-17", "Step back in time and see World War I like never before. This powerful visual journey brings the Great War to life through a stunning collection of colorized images, originally captured in black and white and transformed using cutting-edge technology. Each photograph has been carefully restored and colorized to reveal new dimensions of history, emotion and humanity, offering a vivid and immersive perspective on one of the most significant conflicts in world history."],
    ["Zia and the Cloud Garden","zia_and_the_cloud_garden.jpg","B0F3FB5HHZ", "Ages 5-17", "In a quiet village nestled among misty hills, a bright-eyed girl named Zia finds magic in the skies she loves so dearly. When a golden cloud invites her on an unforgettable journey, Zia discovers a secret world where dreams help things grow—and learns that even the sky can feel like home."],
    ["Vintage Madras","vintage_madras.jpg","B0F9XDJQ7Q", "Ages 5 & above", "This unique book breathes new life into rare archival photographs of Madras, transforming black-and-white memories into vivid, full-color portraits using AI. Each image offers a stunning glimpse into the city's rich cultural tapestry, colonial architecture and everyday life of a bygone era. A visual journey that bridges history and innovation, it invites you to rediscover Madras like never before, nostalgic, vibrant and timeless."],
    ["The Skystone Expedition","skystone_expedition.jpg","B0F74JLK4G", "Ages 4-12", "When a stormy night stirs something magical, 8-year-old Atlas discovers a glowing stone that sets his compass spinning wildly. Guided by riddles, enchanted landscapes, and strange challenges, he ventures deep into a world shaped by imagination. Along the way, he must make choices that test his courage and heart. But when the journey ends, one question remains-was it all a dream, or something more?"]
  ]
};
